# macOS installer options. --type dmg produces a drag-to-install disk image
# (no code signing). Use pkg instead for an installer package. Signing /
# notarization (--mac-sign, --mac-signing-key-user-name) is required before
# distribution outside your own machines.
--type
dmg
--mac-package-name
"Liberty Shop"
--mac-package-identifier
mg.houssen.libertyshop
